# Prototype build output ONLY, never sources: build.sh writes the binary next to
# its source at prototype/<op>/<op>. A bare `prototype/**/<op>` matches the
# DIRECTORY as well and silently ignores the whole op directory — which is how
# both kernel directories vanished from git with their sources untracked. Name
# the binary path exactly and add one line per new op (or build into
# prototype/<op>/build/, already covered).
prototype/lm_head_gemv/lm_head_gemv
prototype/gdn_decode/gdn_decode
prototype/mlp_gemv/mlp_gemv
prototype/proj_gemv/proj_gemv
prototype/attn_decode/attn_decode
*.o
